# The two pilots of the Decide port (docs/adr/0091 §6, §7). KEY=VALUE, one
# per line, `#` comments on their own line. A decision whose confidence (the
# probability of its winning outcome) is under its threshold goes to a person.
#
# Provenance, decision: ADR 0091's, the band 0.2 < p < 0.8 left to a person
# in both pilots; checked against the demo intake's measure and the
# labelled set's (the ADR's Consequences and the M58 handoff).
PERIMETER_CONFIDENCE=0.8
SCREEN_CONFIDENCE=0.8
